[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3956974757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116747#issuecomment-3956974757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116747","id":3956974757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r2qSl","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T05:38:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T05:38:49Z","body":"This is not a bug. We previously discussed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72336 that this specification was standardized to maintain consistency with other editors (such as the scene dock).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3956974757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957000981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116747#issuecomment-3957000981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116747","id":3957000981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r2wsV","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T05:47:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T06:04:56Z","body":"Sorry I mistakenly closed this confused with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116732.\r\n\r\nThe issue is inconsistency. The AnimationPlayerEditor and glTF importer perform renaming with auto-incrementing for consistency with things like TreeDock, so an implementation that aligns with this needs to be made.\r\n\r\nThis increment operation is performed individually in multiple places within Godot (I assume you can search them with `\"_\" +` or `_%d`), so it might be a good refactoring to place it as a helper function somewhere, taking a callback argument for duplicate checking. Well, that can be a separate PR; here, it's okay if AnimationLibraryManager and AnimationPlayerEditor are consistent.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957000981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957480007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116747#issuecomment-3957480007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116747","id":3957480007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r4lpH","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T07:58:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T07:58:00Z","body":"Now, both AnimationLibraryManager and AnimationPlayerEditor have same behaviours to show alert when we try to use duplicated name.\r\n\r\nAnd I think I can investigate the validation callback way as you mentioned. I want to make sure, which one we should focus on. Should we refact the duplication validation function, or increment function?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957480007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957833703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116747#issuecomment-3957833703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116747","id":3957833703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r57_n","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T09:09:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T09:21:00Z","body":"If we were to unify through refactoring, it would be implement increment helper function like:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nstatic String get_safe_name(String p_name, const Callable &p_method); // p_method is func which checks name existance like has()\r\n```\r\n```cpp\r\nname = Object::get_safe_name(name, callable_mp(animation_library, &AnimationLibrary::has_animation));\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen there are duplicate names, for example in importers, the incrementing behavior is likely being implicitly used. Therefore, adding validation to discard such cases here would break compatibility.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3957833703/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]